<title>PHILIPPINES: TABLE-Jollibee Q2 net 179.6 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Jollibee Q2 net 179.6 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to June 30</p>
<p>			(in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Revenues		   2,180 vs 1,580</p>
<p>    Net income		   179.6 vs n/a</p>
<p>Note: Full name is Jollibee Foods Corp. It said it made a gain of 21.1 million pesos from the sale of a property. Consolidated net profit before non-recurring items amounted to 158.4 million pesos compared with the year-ago 148.1 million.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8939 Fax 817--6267</p>
